SUMMARY:Rock to the Future Lyric Lab
DESCRIPTION:Lyric Lab is Rock to the Future’s new rap and songwriting pro
 gram designed for young artists ready to turn their thoughts\, feelings\, 
 and stories into real music. Whether students are already writing bars or 
 just getting started\, participants build skills in writing powerful lyric
 s\, finding their flow\, riding the beat\, performing with confidence\, an
