 rings together sketchbooks\, preparatory studies\, serial prints\, and sui
 tes of drawings to reveal how artists develop ideas over time.\n\nWhether 
 used for training\, observation\, material experimentation\, or formal inv
 estigation\, repetition emerges as a fundamental creative strategy. By…\
 n\nhttps://www.creativephl.org/arts-event/one-after-another-series-and-stu
