SUMMARY:William Penn & Lenni Lenape Community Building Conversations
DESCRIPTION:The William Penn and Lenni Lenape monthly conversations are hos
 ted by the Francisville Neighborhood Development Corporation\, (FNDC). The
  discussions are curated to understand the altruistic vision William Penn 
